{"skill":{"slug":"zoho-inventory","displayName":"zoho-inventory"},"version":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790941453141,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":68218,"sha256":"bbaf523bbbf3d41c04bafcfb2f6b7c91f8146ee16d0e5dd1ac4dee39513bbb31","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2330,"sha256":"5e00ba9527d4a9ab9b50c58ba42ebc3c8fe29a59cf2cd8cfd606620ff444193d","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790941758894,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"d7bd06759ea3c1a7a4fbf63ef16f79571695ce976d510c4eea1de872a458e01a","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/d7bd06759ea3c1a7a4fbf63ef16f79571695ce976d510c4eea1de872a458e01a","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790941617614},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1790941758894},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Zoho Inventory integration that can perform sensitive business-data actions, but its high-impact actions are documented with user-approval and scoping requirements.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, Bash, and authenticated Maton/Zoho access are proportionate for an API integration, though users should expect access to inventory, orders, invoices, bills, contacts, and shipments within the connected account.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses the Maton CLI through pinned npm or Homebrew instructions; no executable scripts are shipped in the artifact.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package includes shared trigger references for non-Zoho event sources such as Calendly, but the main skill and reference files state these are platform catalogues only, do not widen Zoho Inventory access, and should be used only when the user asks for that source by name.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"OAuth credentials, hosted functions, triggers, and trigger destinations can persist, but the skill discloses this and requires explicit approval, least-privilege scoping, DENY_ALL network policy by default for functions, and confirmation before writes or forwarding.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is Zoho Inventory CRUD and automation through Maton, and the documented API calls, connection handling, functions, and triggers align with that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be aware this skill can read and modify real Zoho Inventory business records and can set up persistent automations if you approve them. Use read-only scopes where possible, confirm every write or automation, and avoid third-party trigger destinations unless you understand exactly what data will be forwarded and for how long.","findings":"[SDI-2] expected: The Calendly trigger reference is not part of Zoho Inventory CRUD, but the artifact explicitly frames it as shared Maton platform trigger documentation, says it does not expand this skill's app scope, and limits use to cases where the user has connected Calendly and asks for it by name.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790941758894}}}}}